# CVE-2024-52308 - GitHub CLI remote code execution via malicious Codespaces
# Affects: gh CLI (Trivy reports as v2.0.0-20251104174640-152d328db80d - misread)
# Actual Version: 2.83.0 (verified via podman run --rm localhost/test-project-container:latest gh --version)
# Issue: RCE when connecting to malicious Codespaces SSH server
# Risk: FALSE POSITIVE - Trivy gobinary scanner misreads version from Go binary build info
# Fixed Version: 2.62.0
# Status: Not vulnerable - actual version 2.83.0 is well above fixed version 2.62.0
# Root Cause: Known limitation with Trivy parsing Go binary embedded build info
# Verification: Confirmed gh version 2.83.0 (2025-11-04) via container execution
# Action: None required - false positive, actual version is patched
CVE-2024-52308

